# Recognition of marked cubic extensions

The residual is identified in coordinates chosen from its specified cubic
subgroups. The fixed four-group actions retain both marked involutions,
and internal complements give actual ambient group isomorphisms.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, F.6.16, printed p.308.
-/
